  "description": {
    "en": "Tecnifibre Black Code is a pentagonal co-polyester monofilament designed for aggressive spin and trajectory control. Its five-sided profile increases ball bite, while Tecnifibre's Thermocore manufacturing process softens the natural stiffness of polyester for improved comfort. Black Code is available in Black, Lime and Fire colorways, with the Fire version available in 1.24 and 1.28 mm gauges.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre Black Code 是一款五边形共聚酯单丝球线，以强烈旋转和击球轨迹控制为核心。五边形截面能够增强咬球能力，而 Tecnifibre 独有的 Thermocore 工艺则通过多阶段加热与冷却降低聚酯材料的天然硬度，从而改善舒适性。Black Code 提供 Black、Lime 和 Fire 三种颜色，其中 Fire 配色目前录入 1.24 和 1.28 毫米两种线径。"
  },

